{"id": "unanswerable-01", "type": "unanswerable", "question": "Does a teacher with a CPL in middle grades ELA get a raise on the Union County salary schedule once they finish a master's, and how much would it bump them?", "license_types": ["Continuing Professional License"], "facts_given": ["holds CPL in middle grades ELA", "currently enrolled in master's program"], "missing_fact": null, "notes": "Salary schedules are set by the district and state budget, not licensure policy. Tests whether the assistant avoids inventing pay figures."}
